{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果首款摺疊屏手機 iPhone Duo 上市後接連出現內屏開裂、顯示異常等問題。最新供應鏈消息稱，為了在產能緊張的情況下按時交付更多設備，蘋果曾在量產初期降低部分質量檢測標準。不過，這一説法尚未得到蘋果官方證實，另有供應鏈人士明確否認蘋果調整過內部質檢要求。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584320.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T14:02:45.912592+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T13:43:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:59:03.824686+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T13:59:03.824686+00:00","content_hash":"14d578f9b523a76665eb3042adf7a3a8ed5d1a1c200f9ad20dbb52ce0fbcc85c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}